  "abstract": "We add a per-factor Mixture-of-Oscillators (Q=3) over (r,w) prototypes with input-adaptive softmax gating from mean/velocity context in factor space. This yields context-conditional dynamics a_b,b_b while retaining factorized loadings, temporal/horizon gating, residual copy, and curvature regularization. V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5) encourages diverse factor bases.",
